  "rationale": "P0 of the sixth droplet forward for n-heptane, data-informed (not zero-shot): the carried numbers with four laws revised from the physical mechanism and an independent re-derivation on train: a cool-flame rate with no oxygen or pressure dependence; the cool-flame end diameter as a law in oxygen partial pressure with a limit; a flame born below its end diameter decays (the helium patch is removed); a helium term in the radiative clock. The flame cameras are not read. Every number typed by the author; no fit, no search; no validation outcome was read.",
